      "text": "Scalability & Availability in AWS",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "hM4ApxALamaXxC31evBrJ",
      "originalText": "Scalability & Availability in AWS",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "jGoEgTkdI8mw4HVmlm2OM",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1840.0717546076967,
      "y": 21032.48434159308,
      "width": 176,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bLE",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 485752044,
      "version": 21,
      "versionNonce": 1851028083,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788269481891,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Scalablility -> ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Scalablility -> ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "gBPovPxB1err3zKQ7Jfy9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1890.1615983576967,
      "y": 21061.24215409308,
      "width": 1144,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bLF",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 995786964,
      "version": 709,
      "versionNonce": 624452157,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788269481891,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "It means that an application or system can adapt to handle higher loads.\n1 Vertical Scaling -> here we try to improve specs of our Machine , like t2.micro to any large machine\n2. Horizontal Scaling -> To achieve this we can spin up multiple EC2 instance and manage traffic on them\n    using load balancer.\ntwo type of Horizontal scaling accoring to req\n    1. Auto Scaling -> automatically EC2 will be spin up and attached to LB.\n    2. Manual Scaling.\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "It means that an application or system can adapt to handle higher loads.\n1 Vertical Scaling -> here we try to improve specs of our Machine , like t2.micro to any large machine\n2. Horizontal Scaling -> To achieve this we can spin up multiple EC2 instance and manage traffic on them\n    using load balancer.\ntwo type of Horizontal scaling accoring to req\n    1. Auto Scaling -> automatically EC2 will be spin up and attached to LB.\n    2. Manual Scaling.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "sTBEQ6E8LxgNFMbOvXMiE",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1844.0717546076967,
      "y": 21285.48434159308,
      "width": 165,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bLG",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1023836724,
      "version": 23,
      "versionNonce": 849587219,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788269481891,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Availability ->",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Availability ->",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "NQLx3qjUS0pvYmDRRZuf0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1886.0717546076967,
      "y": 21310.48434159308,
      "width": 1045,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bLI",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 821740980,
      "version": 167,
      "versionNonce": 2076906141,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788269481891,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "It can be achieved by putting our data in multiple availability zones. if one have some problem\nthen traffic will be redirected to other machine.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "It can be achieved by putting our data in multiple availability zones. if one have some problem\nthen traffic will be redirected to other machine.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "0UVfansBiL4zCys_IFQmz",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1840.0717546076967,
      "y": 21457.48434159308,
      "width": 143,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bLJ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1442931596,
      "version": 17,
      "versionNonce": 1209708979,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788269481891,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Elasticity ->",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Elasticity ->",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Cx8uMqSqKAoqWQdztiwNj",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1873.4233171076967,
      "y": 21488.74606034308,
      "width": 1067,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bLL",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 391217420,
      "version": 168,
      "versionNonce": 1634252541,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788269481891,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Once a system is properly scalable, elasticity means that there will be automatic scaling applied\non the system based on the load.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Once a system is properly scalable, elasticity means that there will be automatic scaling applied\non the system based on the load.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
